[p]Dear Players:[/p][p]"DREAD FLATS" - an immersive first-person Chinese horror game officially launches today (July 11)![/p][p][/p][p]You'll play as a famous video blogger invited to explore a creepy abandoned building, uncovering the terrifying truth behind the mass disappearance of residents years ago. Dark corridors, eerie whispers, unexplained phenomena... every detail hides bone-chilling secrets.[/p][p][/p][p]A Letter to Players:[/p][p]As our studio's debut project, "DREAD FLATS" embodies countless days and nights of our team's exploration and experimentation. While we've given our all, as new developers, the game may have imperfections - some content might not be fully polished, and you may encounter bugs or machine-translated text (currently Chinese, English and Japanese are human-translated; other languages use machine translation due to budget constraints). We sincerely apologize and promise to: prioritize fixing all reported bugs and strive to optimize your experience.[/p][p][/p][p]Future Update Plans:
・Graphics upgrade: Adding 2K/4K high-resolution support;
・Language optimization: Continuous iteration of multilingual versions to improve text quality;
・Content expansion: Adjusting game details based on player feedback.[/p]
